From 0f0f18dd1b764f81512f84f683feb22d949d471d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:09:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] chore(process): PROCESS_VERSION 18 - covers the camcraft-mcp
 skill rows merged with #930

PR #1117 took PROCESS_VERSION 17. PR #930 also changed a process file
(.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md: rows for set_tool_holder and
list_holder_library) while the number stayed 17, because both PRs changed
16 -> 17 and git merged the identical change. AGENTS.md says the second to
merge takes the next number, so forks that synced at 17 would not pull the
#930 change. This moves the number to 18.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .claude/PROCESS_VERSION | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.claude/PROCESS_VERSION b/.claude/PROCESS_VERSION
index 98d9bcb75..3c032078a 100644
--- a/.claude/PROCESS_VERSION
+++ b/.claude/PROCESS_VERSION
@@ -1 +1 @@
-17
+18
